Note on the bundled audio

The 52 piano samples under assets/notes/ are the white keys of a standard
88-key piano, A0 to C8.  They are included here for demonstration purposes;
their provenance is not documented in the original project.  Verify the
licence before any commercial use, and note that the MIT grant above covers
this project's source code, not necessarily those recordings.
